From 5cb528bcd6eb9120613d6baa57961dbd6307a453 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: priyadharshini <priyadharshini.m@digifyce.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:16:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add two-way task sync with the new Brand OS app

Mirrors the existing DigiOps sync pattern but over a webhook, since Brand
OS lives on a separate host: outbound task creation/updates go through
Brand OS's REST API, and HRMS status changes push back through a new
/webhooks/hrms-task-status call added alongside every existing
_digiops_task_sync() call site.

- migrate_brandos_link.php: adds tasks.brandos_deliverable_id
- brandos_sync_helper.php: _brandos_task_sync(), configured via
  BRANDOS_WEBHOOK_URL / BRANDOS_WEBHOOK_SECRET in .env
- api.php: tasks POST/PUT now accept brandos_deliverable_id so Brand OS
  can tag a task as its own when creating it via the API

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
